2. Institutional Context & Ownership Considerations:
   This software was developed in connection with student team participation in
   the IN-SPACe CAN-7USAT India Student Competition. Student enrollment at an
   academic institution (such as Manipal Institute of Technology, MAHE) does
   not automatically vest software copyright in the institution under standard
   copyright law (e.g., student work is generally not a "work made for hire"
   absent an express written employment contract, sponsored research agreement,
   or specific university intellectual property policy governing substantial
   use of specialized institutional facilities/funds).
   
   However, because formal institutional clearance has not been obtained, any
   applicable university IP regulations, student handbook agreements, or
   competition participation agreements should be verified if formal commercial
   or institutional transfer is contemplated. No claim of official university
   endorsement, sponsorship, or legal assignment by MAHE or IN-SPACe is made.

